concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57bb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57BB Meaning of Australian repairer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57bb ;
    values:originalText "A person is an Australian repairer to the extent that the person carries on or actively seeks to carry on, in Australia, a business that involves diagnosing faults with, servicing, repairing, modifying or dismantling scheme vehicles. Note: In some State and Territory jurisdictions, a person may need to hold a licence or particular qualifications to lawfully carry on such a business." ;
    skos:definition "A person is an Australian repairer to the extent that the person carries on or actively seeks to carry on, in Australia, a business that involves diagnosing faults with, servicing, repairing, modifying or dismantling scheme vehicles. Note: In some State and Territory jurisdictions, a person may need to hold a licence or particular qualifications to lawfully carry on such a business."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6e34b592b08cd921dc8d392764997c9cc7957099eff715f6a5eb3647ddbf756d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person is an Australian repairer to the extent that they carry on or actively seek to carry on, in Australia, a business that involves diagnosing faults with, servicing, repairing, modifying or dismantling scheme vehicles." ;
