concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57be a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57BE Meaning of data provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57be ;
    values:originalText "A data provider is:  (a) a corporation carrying on a business that includes supplying, to any extent and whether directly or indirectly, scheme information to one or more Australian repairers or scheme RTOs; or  (b) any person who carries on such a business in the course of, or in relation to, trade or commerce." ;
    skos:definition "A data provider is:  (a) a corporation carrying on a business that includes supplying, to any extent and whether directly or indirectly, scheme information to one or more Australian repairers or scheme RTOs; or  (b) any person who carries on such a business in the course of, or in relation to, trade or commerce."@en ;
