    cml:logicSummary "Defines the scope of safety information for specific systems" ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) Safety information, for a scheme vehicle..." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The safety information is relevant for the hydrogen system, high voltage system, hybrid system, and electric propulsion system" ;
