concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57ca-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57CA(4) Scheme information—offer to supply to Australian repairers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57ca-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The data provider must make a scheme offer for the supply of the scheme information in relation to a particular make, model or year of scheme vehicle at a price (the scheme price) that does not exceed the fair market value of the information, as determined by reference to matters including those covered by subsection (5). Note: A pecuniary penalty of up to $10,000,000 may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection: see section 76." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The data provider must make a scheme offer for the supply of the scheme information in relation to a particular make, model or year of scheme vehicle at a price (the scheme price) that does not exceed the fair market value of the information, as determined by reference to matters including those covered by subsection (5). Note: A pecuniary penalty of up to $10,000,000 may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection: see section 76."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e61a2a73dcfe3f7773da27f2b1d8e9448ccf82240c8b390ade0f932b4a136794" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57ca ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Data provider must make a scheme offer for the supply of scheme information at a price not exceeding fair market value." ;
