    cof:title "57CB(2) Scheme information—supply on request by Australian" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The data provider must supply the scheme information to the Australian repairer or scheme RTO:  (a) in accordance with terms and conditions that comply with section 57CC; and  (b)  within the period covered by subsection (3). Note: A pecuniary penalty of up to $10,000,000 may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection: see section 76." ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57cb-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57CB(3) Scheme information—supply on request by Australian"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57cb-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), the period covered by this subsection:  (a) starts when (at the payment or offer time) the Australian repairer or scheme RTO pays, or offers to pay, the scheme price, or another agreed price, for the scheme information; and  (b) in the circumstances described in column 1 of an item of the following table, ends at the time described in column 2 of that item.   Schedule 1  Motor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme" ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), the period covered by this subsection:  (a) starts when (at the payment or offer time) the Australian repairer or scheme RTO pays, or offers to pay, the scheme price, or another agreed price, for the scheme information; and  (b) in the circumstances described in column 1 of an item of the following table, ends at the time described in column 2 of that item.   Schedule 1  Motor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme"@en ;
