doc:sch-1-sec-57cc-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "57CC(2) Scheme information—terms and conditions of supply and use" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, a data provider must not enter into a contract for the supply of scheme information under this Part that contains any of the following terms or conditions:  (a) a term or condition requiring an Australian repairer or scheme RTO to acquire one or more services or products from the data provider or any other person;  (b) a term or condition allowing an increase, after the contract is made, in the price for the supply of the scheme information under the contract;  (c) a term or condition prohibited by the scheme rules. Civil penalty:  (a) for a body corporate—600 penalty units; and  (b) for a person other than a body corporate—120 penalty units.  Schedule 1  Motor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme" ;
