concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57cd-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57CD(4) Scheme information—interaction of supply obligations and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57cd-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An amount payable by the data provider under subsection (3):  (a) is a debt due by the data provider to the third party claimant; and  (b) may be recovered by action in a court of competent jurisdiction." ;
    skos:definition "(4) An amount payable by the data provider under subsection (3):  (a) is a debt due by the data provider to the third party claimant; and  (b) may be recovered by action in a court of competent jurisdiction."@en ;
