concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57eh-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57EH(3) Costs of mediation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57eh-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The costs of mediation under this Division under subsection (1) include the following:  (a) the cost of the mediator;  (b) the cost of any additional input (including from technical experts) agreed by both parties to be necessary to conduct the mediation." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The costs of mediation under this Division under subsection (1) include the following:  (a) the cost of the mediator;  (b) the cost of any additional input (including from technical experts) agreed by both parties to be necessary to conduct the mediation."@en ;
