doc:sch-1-sec-57gd-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "57GD(2) Acquisition of property" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The provision has no effect to the extent (if any) to which its operation would result in the acquisition of property (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution) from a person otherwise than on just terms (within the meaning of that paragraph).  Schedule 1  Motor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme" ;
    cof:pageNumber "31"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57ge a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57GE Scheme rules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57ge ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules prescribing matters:  (a) required or permitted by this Part to be prescribed by the rules; or  (b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this Part.  (2) To avoid doubt, the rules may not do the following:  (a) create an offence or civil penalty;  (b) provide powers of:  (i) arrest or detention; or  (ii) entry, search or seizure;  (c) impose a tax;  (d) set an amount to be appropriated from the Consolidated Revenue Fund under an appropriation in this Act;  (e) directly amend the text of this Act;  (f) subject to section 57DB, authorise or require the disclosure of sensitive information.  Motor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Schedule 1 Other amendments  Part 2  No. 54, 2021 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Motor Vehicle Service and Repair Information Sharing Scheme) Act 2021" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules prescribing matters:  (a) required or permitted by this Part to be prescribed by the rules; or  (b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this Part.  (2) To avoid doubt, the rules may not do the following:  (a) create an offence or civil penalty;  (b) provide powers of:  (i) arrest or detention; or  (ii) entry, search or seizure;  (c) impose a tax;  (d) set an amount to be appropriated from the Consolidated Revenue Fund under an appropriation in this Act;  (e) directly amend the text of this Act;  (f) subject to section 57DB, authorise or require the disclosure of sensitive information.  Motor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Schedule 1 Other amendments  Part 2  No. 54, 2021 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Motor Vehicle Service and Repair Information Sharing Scheme) Act 2021"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "90e1bdabc804802227a1891016f04eccc4f79a1ea5333c5e7496d9fc5128db0b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57ge-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2021a00054-sch-1-sec-57ge-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2021a00054.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2021a00054.pdf, p.32" .
doc:sch-1-sec-57ge a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "57GE Scheme rules" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules prescribing matters:  (a) required or permitted by this Part to be prescribed by the rules; or  (b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this Part.  (2) To avoid doubt, the rules may not do the following:  (a) create an offence or civil penalty;  (b) provide powers of:  (i) arrest or detention; or  (ii) entry, search or seizure;  (c) impose a tax;  (d) set an amount to be appropriated from the Consolidated Revenue Fund under an appropriation in this Act;  (e) directly amend the text of this Act;  (f) subject to section 57DB, authorise or require the disclosure of sensitive information.  Motor vehicle service and repair information sharing scheme  Schedule 1 Other amendments  Part 2  No. 54, 2021 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Motor Vehicle Service and Repair Information Sharing Scheme) Act 2021" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

